Customer Service, 
{!Project__c.Name}
is now vacant. Upon arriving at the property to make the move out list, the renovation team discovered potential foundation issues and dispatched the structural engineer to assess the property. The engineer confirmed that foundation repairs are needed. 

We are in the process of obtaining a quote for the foundation repairs recommended by the engineer and will let you know when we receive the quote. We should receive the quote within 48 hours. 

After receiving the quote, we will send a separate email that includes Brett to determine how to handle the situation based on all the variables. After Brett makes the decision, you will then contact the owner to let him/her know what is happening and what we are doing. 

Once approval is given to begin foundation repairs, we expect repairs to be completed in 7-10 days depending on scheduling, weather, inspections, etc. 

The move out list cannot be made before the foundation is complete as additional damages (sheetrock cracking, loose tiles, etc) may occur during the foundation work. After the foundation repairs are completed, we will then make the move out list.